# hunting-grounds-spike.vrs: hunting-grounds D20, the mover spike (Session 0). 12 tracked spiders spawned at the pond
# are moved by NyarDevTools' `.devhop` 25 m east every 5 s, ten times, anchored on the mark hg-s0 (which moves with
# them), while Chaos stands about 150 m north of the line, so no player is within 100 m of any hop (Review 1 F1).
# Then Chaos goes to the end point: where Chaos stands ([DEV WHERE], its height), and `.nyar debug here 15` / `60`
# list the units there. The checklist (alive, within 15 m, heights, crashes) is read from the log afterwards.
#
# `.devunits` after every hop logs each unit's x, y, z, AI state, target and PreCombatPosition (diagnostic: the
# first run lost 6 of 12 from the hop radius after the second hop).
# Run with --var MOVEHOME=false (Translation only) or --var MOVEHOME=true (SpawnTransform moved too).
# Needs: NyarDevTools with .devhop and .devunits, DevChatEcho; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, never false).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devmark hg-s0
expect-log \[DEV MARK\] hg-s0
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Forest 12
expect-log spawn batch: .* 0 waiting timeout=30
wait 5
chat .nyar debug here 15
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest
shot full spike-spawn
# away: about 150 m north of the middle of the line (pond x -1880 .. -1630, z -1640)
chat .devtp -1755 -1490
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 5
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=12
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=12
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 4
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
wait 1
chat .devhop -581295882 25 0 20 hg-s0 ${MOVEHOME}
expect-log \[DEV HOP\] moved=
wait 10
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units:
# the approach: Chaos at the end point (pond + 250 m east)
chat .devgo hg-s0
expect-log \[DEV TP\] hg-s0
wait 4
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .devunits -581295882 300
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\]
chat .nyar debug here 15
chat .nyar debug here 60
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest
shot full spike-end
wait 10
chat .nyar debug here 15
shot full spike-end-10s
chat .nyar purge
wait 2
chat .nyar purge confirm
expect-log purge
wait 20
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0 timeout=40
